    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airborne Arena is a racing-shooter game where you take the role of &quot;The Prodigy&quot;, a hoverbike rider tasked with infiltrating in the gangs of 2058's Rider City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swerve, boost and glide through the streets, blasting your guns at enemies as you fight for the pole position. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airborne Arena mixes some of the best elements of the most adrenaline-inducing racing games with an engaging 3rd person shooting combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock  24 different tracks in the Story Mode. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your reputation to upgrade your V-bike and weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the 3 different Gang Leaders in special Boss Races. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against friends in multiplayer races and deathmatch arenas.<br> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the most legendary Viker in the whole of Rider City.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airborne Arena is a racing-shooter game where you take the role of &quot;The Prodigy&quot;, a hoverbike rider tasked with infiltrating in the gangs of 2058's Rider City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swerve, boost and glide through the streets, blasting your guns at enemies as you fight for the pole position. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airborne Arena mixes some of the best elements of the most adrenaline-inducing racing games with an engaging 3rd person shooting combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock  24 different tracks in the Story Mode. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your reputation to upgrade your V-bike and weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the 3 different Gang Leaders in special Boss Races. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against friends in multiplayer races and deathmatch arenas.<br> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the most legendary Viker in the whole of Rider City.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Airborne Arena is a shooter-racing game set in 2058's Rider City. Enter an action-packed new reality filled with deadly hoverbike races, as you take the role of &quot;The Prodigy&quot; and infiltrate the different Viker gangs in the story mode or challenge your friends to online races and deathmatch arenas.",
